{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "1a0f157dd674f531d9df1bf191e7596441e9b0b32a61bfcf1487549aa43cd2dc", "ja": "みんなの気持ち", "zh": "众人的心思", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a39a83bf89019447ef8be5b8630b462c5522ec8dc9e59ee751d73e9db6e32898", "ja": "秘密の特訓の成果で、ダンスが上達している\n可奈。今日もあずさと居残りレッスンに向か\nうが、レッスンルームには歩の姿が。さらに\n真と雪歩も現れ、思わぬ全体練習が始まる。\n5人の気持ちがひとつになろうとしていた。", "zh": "秘密特训有成，可奈跳舞越来越熟练。\n她今天也跟梓一起准备留下来训练，\n却在练习室里看见步的身影。\n随后，真与雪步也一起出现。\n偶然齐聚一堂的五人开始全体练习，迈向团结一心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7c5bae6c8e12191747605efe726164faca8b9c1ebdc9c0f5c31b7a264ea7af72", "ja": "（本番まで、あと一週間を切った。BIRTHの\nパフォーマンスはどんどん磨きがかかってきている）", "zh": "（距离正式公演只剩一星期。\n『BIRTH』的表现越来越优秀。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "b0348cd5ab4725a70ab4fbb872ec8fb4b8515c079b2522809081a86c60c4d82c", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nい、今のダンス、もしかして……！？", "zh": "呼、呼……\n我、我刚才跳得是不是……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0c0f0de42b39df29c8d71db7ca5c44e649dff7fccbf241197a7c63bab3fdfcb1", "ja": "可奈、良かったよ今の！\nめちゃくちゃ上手くなってないか！？", "zh": "可奈，你刚才跳得很好喔！\n你变得超厉害了耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "ac402448d8a22aa43dddeb8081ac6f431c11d93bb496687298405e36f0221d16", "ja": "あっ、歩さん！\nえへっ、そうかな～？　上手になってるかな～？", "zh": "啊，步姊！\n嘿嘿，是这样吗～？我变厉害了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8f3735478562ef177bd611ff0a115690c813b611a3869b9fb1426c24016be7b7", "ja": "うん、今のはなかなか良かったと思う。\nこの調子で、本番も頑張ろう！", "zh": "嗯，我也觉得刚才跳得挺不错。\n正式公演也像这样加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "79b4ca30abe789b95ef86a1b6dac13d989f8a536c7bcf35edf121eb43320713e", "ja": "よかったわね、可奈ちゃん。\nやっぱり、特訓の成果かしら……うふふ。", "zh": "太好了呢，可奈。\n这果然是特训的成果吧……唔呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "c1b0d876ef0c3c633dbf5f5716dd81a5fb6886bfe3c8affb2959b132c11e581b", "ja": "そうだと思います！\nえへへ、今日も頑張るぞー！　おー！", "zh": "我也这么觉得！\n嘿嘿，我今天也要加油──！喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "9228ac9f0b84185d1089aec3d456e7dd16a8ed9872350d220fe8161add57912e", "ja": "いけいけゴーゴー矢吹可奈～♪\n最強ダンスに近づこう～♪", "zh": "上啊上啊GO GO，矢吹可奈～♪\n努力跳出最强舞蹈吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "abe37e1801fb2f7db815b47e15a0fbb3553ec66aafe5beb83750512d6112890b", "ja": "（今日も、あずささんと可奈は居残りレッスンするって\n言ってたな。そろそろ様子を見に……）", "zh": "（记得梓小姐跟可奈说过，今天也要留下来训练。\n是时候去看看她们的情况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c2332064f4f2c88c15ecbdec16898d91c513263c92385a66bc9e0f8a0332bad4", "ja": "ん？　あずささんに可奈……\n廊下なんかで、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "嗯？梓小姐跟可奈……\n你们怎么站在走廊上？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "9a64dc4cc65a90eecdf616808277329f115f478de41baffb7b25feda19021e87", "ja": "{$P$}さん、しーっ。\n今、歩ちゃんがレッスン室を使っているんです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，嘘～！\n小步正在用练习室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "042c27c7dd57fb7d38dec822e02d8cbf123eeefb645072537118eddcf640cb4b", "ja": "歩が？", "zh": "你说步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e0a2e956f11f27685cf338a4fb768ddcf82d0b086a63132afc38550340127bee", "ja": "（レッスンルームでは、歩がひとりでダンスの\nおさらいをしている。真剣な表情だ）", "zh": "（步一个人在练习室里复习舞蹈。\n她的表情好认真。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "23f44701b4587859faa10bb5532334c99e7d81ee7c61f5b4db67ba7231d7cf16", "ja": "1、2、3、4……。\nよしっ、こんなもんかな！　えーっと、次は……。", "zh": "1、2、3、4……\n好，大概就是这样吧！呃～接下来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3cca03c404c6aee5661ffe3ab057b3867bdef15a1a76a142e37ee51516c78410", "ja": "歩、まだ練習する気なのか？", "zh": "步，你还要继续练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9ae550026d1b276b52e26dc68086dc32fb06dab22af4454ded7e8eb2571a57cc", "ja": "わあっ！？　……{$P$}！\nそれに、あずさと可奈まで！？", "zh": "哇啊！？……{$P$}！\n连梓跟可奈都在！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a0ea177440249fbe439b4f8160d581884016027bc9dae4499ae4dabc34ba71ae", "ja": "もう、いつから見てたんだよ？\n見学するならするって、そう言ってよ～。", "zh": "真是的，你们从什么时候开始看的啊？\n既然要观摩就跟我说一声嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f4322b39aaf0773599fb4d660864ffe6c2c99df2a0e086485a0e004ddf226252", "ja": "ごめんごめん。\n歩が真剣だったから、邪魔しちゃ悪いと思ってな。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，因为你练得很认真，\n我们想说不好意思打扰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a7032010470767b5f492bfffaa7a2e10f73754ce05f2ce3828f1fc9a24b72121", "ja": "でも、みんなしてどうしたの？\nなんか忘れ物？", "zh": "不过，怎么大家都来了？\n有东西忘了拿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "2fce0934b05593984eb4ea6978f4cf29e7a3659390498558e2f97fd1dff577c2", "ja": "うふふ。……実はね、私と可奈ちゃんも\n居残りでダンスの特訓をしていたの。", "zh": "唔呵呵……其实啊，\n我跟可奈也一直都有留下来做舞蹈特训。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2b99c034e3e63abc9918b85ae08a3aba88a7d98f4085b23c58e0d5fe4a595d75", "ja": "えっ！？　な、なんで？　だってふたりとも、\nちゃんと踊れるようになってるのに……。", "zh": "咦！？为、为什么？\n你们两个不是都能跳得很好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "d0f42a0394f4b7b1121cd78db0c9dfc76023a909f5999f4f5069f390d3bec808", "ja": "それが、私たちの特訓の成果なんです！\nそうですよね、あずささん♪", "zh": "那就是我们特训的成果！\n对吧，阿梓姊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "a38f7f0a67b4d036e2867100095822d1a21b11687dcbc2dd78055266dcef7fd1", "ja": "ええ。私たち、少しでも歩ちゃんや真ちゃんに\n追いつかなくちゃと思って……。", "zh": "是啊。\n我们想要尽可能追上小步与小真……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "add9d4650732e5a23555fe37fcc8bb708d8113c9db3bb07a3d4d7091412edb0b", "ja": "でもでも、やっとちょっぴり追いついたところなのに。\n歩さんにそんなに頑張られちゃったら……。", "zh": "可是可是，我们好不容易追上来一点点，\n要是步姊又这么拚命努力的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "f8276c1a151f560bcbea9a8274991ef37182245d099afec5e615f94073d1b8b1", "ja": "いつまでたっても、追いつけそうにないわね～。\nうふふ。", "zh": "不管过多久，我们似乎都追不上你呢～\n唔呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "08d3b277b098c3bf3126914931a1db03d854b48ba873f9e82d7ff4d7d0ad0c1c", "ja": "ええっ！？\nや、やだなぁ、そんなことないって～！", "zh": "什么！？\n讨、讨厌啦，才没有这种事～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "76e1fcabb88dea853d2370d11b04ba63f8a8855e497b21e688f99a45152129e5", "ja": "それよりも、ふたりがそんなふうにダンスを\n練習してたなんて……アタシ、すっごく嬉しいよ！", "zh": "不说这个了，原来你们一直这么努力练习跳舞……\n我听了非常高兴喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "9853c2e16ae393ffe155c12c2fee309a5dfe2097e35bfc0c4bf6508d66a70e8b", "ja": "そうか。\n歩はみんながダンスを頑張ってくれて、嬉しいのか。", "zh": "是吗？\n大家很努力练习跳舞，会让步觉得高兴啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "63585f9978ee5b720821ec4be0ce465bca79a4953e999163f166f06b7bb9099f", "ja": "もちろんだよ！　ちょっとはダンスの楽しさ、\n伝わったのかな～って。", "zh": "那还用说！我会觉得，\n好像让大家稍微领悟到跳舞的乐趣了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "7f28d21db4f1010407eb8eda0aac8e893cb81d579127297c2648c07510ac8a3d", "ja": "でもでも、私なんてまだまだヘタっぴだから、\n特訓なんて笑われちゃうかと思ってました。", "zh": "可是可是，因为我现在还跳得很差劲，\n本来还以为你会笑我居然有在做特训。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f36495da9c3a7f6e7b9b6175f4e74275c7a752e4953dcd0b8f54bb5bb7506db9", "ja": "笑わないって！\n一生懸命頑張ってる人を笑ったりしないよ。", "zh": "我才不会笑你！\n我怎么可能会嘲笑拚命努力的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2dea05ad762370700167b1e835cba6957a3fb201e2b206617403a9941c71f274", "ja": "アタシだって、最初から踊れたワケじゃないし。\nできないコトがいっぱいあった。", "zh": "我自己也不是一开始就跳得很好呀。\n以前我也有一堆不会的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "887dc30484548af088a14652b1f818e4107c0ea358f6482237eb76da8d4a97fc", "ja": "だからダンス苦手だって言ってた可奈が\n頑張ってくれてるの、すっごく嬉しいんだ。へへっ♪", "zh": "所以听到本来说自己不擅长跳舞的可奈愿意努力练习，\n我真的非常高兴，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "699aa54f7f51b1312300cd035091b91d6134d737ba0cb337b7056af920f935d2", "ja": "歩さん……。", "zh": "步姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "54b5cfd5eb209c0c832aefba4f9f84fd80b63df83b2ae5ae3bfb049c1b042fd4", "ja": "それにアタシ、BIRTHのメンバーに選ばれたの、\nすごく嬉しくて……今でもドキドキしてるんだ。", "zh": "况且我非常庆幸自己能被选为『BIRTH』的成员……\n直到现在心还是跳得好快呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ecee39ee8de9a4d9c9edfd31fea3cd7ae0b5a72a5c8812496200e9e74b472f9e", "ja": "リーダーの真のコト、\n少しでも手伝いたい気持ちもあるし……なんて。", "zh": "我也希望可以尽量帮上真这个队长的忙……\n我是这样想啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "72499f6f1b30ccfb48b9869b03b7d21acc974df0650c002cc29ddeef943f5ae4", "ja": "なら早速、歩に手伝ってもらおうかな。\nあずささんと可奈のダンスを見てほしいんだけど。", "zh": "那就马上请步来帮忙吧。\n我想拜托你看一下梓小姐跟可奈的舞蹈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6bc36a46142347498378824cb2338c18b3bfb106ceece73da793fbe881e2a014", "ja": "え！？　アタシが！？\nも、もちろん、いいよ！　協力させて！", "zh": "咦！？我吗！？\n当、当然好呀，让我来帮忙吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1041_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1042_006mak", "source_sha256": "942c3d4b47e61f4eeb7064975aefb6e1b813117df31736ad1baec7cd017ed297", "ja": "失礼しまーす。あっ、{$P$}、\nやっぱりここにいたんですね！", "zh": "打扰了～啊，{$P$}，\n你果然在这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1043_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dfef950ab98a274a271da82faab8ec873d98dac1d5cba2eb7232b356054f0035", "ja": "し、失礼します～。", "zh": "打、打扰了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "5db31a1cb9fed14bf8d3320e305eeac7e39d07b745b970270ce6113f061d0f26", "ja": "あれ？　真に、雪歩も……。\nどうしたんだふたりとも、忘れ物か？", "zh": "咦？真跟雪步都来了……\n你们两个怎么了？忘了拿东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1045_006mak", "source_sha256": "e06ec3f49ec8309af81f341f9675c95b00870edb5cbeb4e190f794231020640e", "ja": "違いますよ！　ボクは自主練しようと思って。\nそしたら雪歩が……。", "zh": "才不是！\n在下打算来自主练习，然后雪步就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1046_004yuk", "source_sha256": "31b866a02dc45b39fd6ff13f20993af8185b8756e627bc24cd843fdfb7c23d6a", "ja": "わ、私も、ダンスをもうちょっと練習したくて……\n真ちゃんに、一緒に練習させてってお願いしたんです。", "zh": "我、我也想再稍微练习一下舞蹈……\n就拜托小真让我跟她一起练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1047_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e4f7a5c86d586c04cf33da51f7dc99c77794552278c658e9e92adc140ce8a55c", "ja": "真と雪歩も！？　もー、みんなで自主練してたら、\n自主練じゃなくなっちゃうじゃん！", "zh": "真跟雪步也是吗！？\n真是的，大家都在的话，就不叫自主练习了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1048_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0d44a922c7b7fc309fdbfca67faffc9388b71dcbdb400df4afefc52409467d6c", "ja": "え……？　じゃあ、みんなも……。", "zh": "咦……？所以你们也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1049_010azu", "source_sha256": "cbd8803a0117e7fba82023d5e8fef3b5a4819d47d764f0b604a534a6b7603edd", "ja": "うふふ。秘密の特訓のつもりが、\n全体練習になっちゃったみたいね～。", "zh": "唔呵呵，原本打算做秘密特训，\n现在看来要变成全体练习了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1050_036kan", "source_sha256": "3019d4c143bf25698d5817bf92e56e3f9da839ceca05fcf0b221554a3adb349a", "ja": "えへっ、そうですね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，就是说呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1051_p", "source_sha256": "5bd33e53c459f8cddb1a3efcc23c79dc6b83912f69defc5ba8ebf1d62012e169", "ja": "みんな、やる気があるのはいいけど、居残りレッスンは\n今日だけだぞ。無理は絶対に駄目だからな！", "zh": "大家，有干劲留下来继续训练是好事，但只限今天喔。\n你们绝对不能逞强！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_05_1052_006mak", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
